{{!
    @template theme_dimensions/competency_course_extra

    The theme's extras of one competency on the course competencies page: the class distribution for staff, the
    learner's own evidence in the course. Drawn into data-region="dim-comp-extra" by the theme's copy of
    tool_lp/course_competencies_page on the first paint, and on the client by theme_dimensions/coursecompetencies
    from theme_dimensions_get_course_competency_extras after core re-renders the page; the context is one entry of
    theme_dimensions\local\competency\coursecompetencies::for_viewer() either way. Every text is plain, printed by
    double stashes. The distribution is the proficient share as tool_lp/progress_bar draws a bar (a native progress
    element, so no style attribute carries a number), then the other two counts.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * competencyid - the competency, which names the section
    * hasdistribution, haslearners - booleans
    * progresstextvalue, percentagevalue, percentlabelvalue - the bar's sentence, share (0 to 100) and label
    * ratedtext, notratedtext - the other two counts as sentences
    * haslearner - boolean; evidencetext - the learner's evidence line

    Example context (json):
    {
        "competencyid": 7,
        "hasdistribution": true,
        "haslearners": true,
        "progresstextvalue": "14 of 24 proficient",
        "percentagevalue": 58,
        "percentlabelvalue": "58%",
        "ratedtext": "7 rated, not proficient",
        "notratedtext": "3 not rated",
        "haslearner": true,
        "evidencetext": "2 pieces of evidence from this course, the latest on 18 October 2026"
    }
}}
<div class="dim-comp-course-extra">
    {{#hasdistribution}}
    <section class="dim-comp-course-class" aria-labelledby="dim-comp-course-class-{{competencyid}}">
        <h4 class="dim-comp-eyebrow" id="dim-comp-course-class-{{competencyid}}">{{#str}} competency_courseclass, theme_dimensions {{/str}}</h4>
        {{#haslearners}}
        {{> tool_lp/progress_bar }}
        <p class="dim-comp-course-class-counts"><span>{{ratedtext}}</span> <span>{{notratedtext}}</span></p>
        {{/haslearners}}
        {{^haslearners}}
        <p class="dim-comp-course-class-none">{{#str}} competency_courseclassnone, theme_dimensions {{/str}}</p>
        {{/haslearners}}
        <p class="dim-comp-course-class-note">{{#str}} competency_courseclassnote, theme_dimensions {{/str}}</p>
    </section>
    {{/hasdistribution}}
    {{#haslearner}}
    <p class="dim-comp-course-mine">
        <i class="fa-regular fa-file-lines" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <span>{{evidencetext}}</span>
    </p>
    {{/haslearner}}
</div>
